[Music]  Parliament committees have heard and  questioned ELISA Ferreira  Yanis lenarcik paolo gentiloni and Kadri  Simpson commissioners designate for  cohesion and reforms crisis management  economy and energy the cohesion and  reform portfolio has been proposed to  ELISA Ferreira from Portugal  she told the Regional Development  Committee that no region should be left  behind I truly believe in this portfolio  and I'm committed to making it work my  attachment to this policy is deeply  personal  I have lived it in every season of my  adult life after 12 years as an MEP the  former Minister for environment answered  questions on topics including defending  a strong budgets for cohesion policy and  how to fight climate change  Yanis Lennar church from slovenia has  been proposed as commissioner for crisis  management a career diplomat he's  currently slovenia's ambassador to the  EU he's worked at the UN and the  Organization for Security and  Cooperation in Europe mep x' asked how  he'd make sure that the delivery of  humanitarian aid would be driven by  values not politics and how the EU would  respond efficiently to crises in order  to strengthen its global role the EU  must upgrade these capacities to be able  to help more people in need swiftly and  efficiently paolo gentiloni is the  choice for the economy portfolio the  former Italian Prime Minister will have  the task of ensuring that economic  policy encourages sustainable growth and  offers the protection and stability  Europeans need today we all feel the  sense of urgency to act to protect our  climates  this will require initiatives on many  fronts sustainable inclusive growth is  the number one priority MEP has  questioned him on how he'll square the  circle of making growth sustainable how  he'll tackle tax havens and tax evasion  and about the European stability and  growth pact the Committee on industry  research and energy quizzed Kadri  Simpson on her plans for the energy  portfolio she's the former Estonian  Minister for Economic Affairs and  Infrastructure  I intend to mobilize energy policy at  the service of the climate neutral  objective by further developing an  integrated interconnected and properly  functioning single market MEP question  her on the 2015 X zero carbon targets  competition in the gas sector and her  plans to combat climate change the vote  in parliament to decide if the  commission as a whole is accepted or  rejected is scheduled for the 23rd of  October  [Music]

